    "explanation": "This ruling concerns trip TRP-02811 on 17 August 2026, from Blk 55 Lengkok Bahru to Blk 610 Clementi West St 1. The rider's claim is that the trip ran 26.39 km against a 20.3 km optimal.\n\nThe measured facts are not in dispute. The GPS trace (EV-GPS-02811) is complete — 207 fixes at 10-second intervals, 100% coverage, zero gaps and a maximum inter-fix gap of 0.0 s, so it is not impaired under POL-RD-07(a)–(c) and no independent-corroboration burden arises. It records 26.39 km driven against the platform optimal of 20.3 km stored on the trip record. The excess is 6.09 km, or 30.0% of optimal, which passes both POL-RD-01 gates (greater than 20% and greater than 0.8 km). A route deviation is therefore established on the governing trace figure.\n\nIt is excused under POL-RD-04. At 06:33:18, one minute after the meter started at 06:32:18, you, the rider, wrote in the chat log 'can we stop at Jurong Point first, need to grab something', and the driver answered 'ok' at 06:33:38. That instruction comes from you, names a specific place, and was given before the vehicle left the optimal corridor, so POL-RD-04(a)–(c) are satisfied. The trace corroborates it: the vehicle's closest fix to the Jurong Point waypoint is 21.7 m, well inside the 200 m test, at 06:49:38. The extra distance of that diversion is therefore excluded before POL-RD-01 and POL-RD-02 are applied. The record shows exactly one rider instruction and exactly one waypoint approach, at the same place; nothing else accounts for the extra kilometres. Once the requested diversion is excluded, no excess remains and no deviation survives, so the metered charge of SGD 34.00 stands and the contested SGD 9.00 is not refunded.\n\nI have considered the rider's argument that POL-RD-04 excuses only the excess 'between leaving and rejoining the optimal corridor' and that no artifact measures that stretch, so the full 6.09 km stands. POL-RD-04 does not require the excluded stretch to be measured by a separate artifact; it requires the instruction to be corroborated on the trace, which it is, and the record identifies a single cause of the deviation. For the same reason the POL-RD-02 arithmetic the rider offers — charged_total SGD 34.00 less a recomputed fare of SGD 27.497 (SGD 6.55, 19.1% of charged_total) — does not arise: POL-RD-02 runs only where a deviation survives the exculpatory clauses.\n\nPOL-RD-06 is not engaged: the excess is below the materiality gate (50% or 8.0 km absolute), and the driver's profile shows one deviation flag in 90 days against 348 completed trips (0.003), far below the 3-flag / 5% pattern. No conduct referral is made. The traffic-advisory artifact EV-ADVIS-02811-01 is missing (weight 0.0, issue MISSING_ARTIFACT); neither party founds the outcome on a traffic cause, so its absence changes nothing and triggers no escalation.\n\nThe outcome is NO_ACTION — the filing party's claim is not supported on this record and the present state stands. The monetary effect is below the SGD 8.00 automatic-execution threshold. This ruling was made without human review; either party may appeal it once within 30 days under POL-GEN-04."
